      <h1 class="jr-h1">Vitamin K2 for Bones: Do You Actually Need It?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Vitamin K2 is now on half the bone supplements sold in India, usually beside a diagram of calcium being steered into your skeleton. The trials are narrower than the diagram — and our own label does not contain it.</p>

